 "assembly_notes": "Compose every seed from the reviewed source pool: one compact open-front base carcass, one thin laminate worktop, four adjustable legs, N source-backed front access units, and a source-backed Shaker or flat face. Structural diversity comes from hinged, drawer, and lift mechanisms plus multiplicity; continuous dimensions adapt those components without simplifying their construction. The plinth-deck body raises the storage deck by a plinth height and sets a dark toe rail back from the front; the cavity floor derives from that rise so every access module opens above the deck. The seamed-slab front keeps its centre field flush with the slab and outlines it with four routed seam strips instead of recessing it.",
